<item>
            <title>[LU-18060] Automatic values for tunables when using lnetctl net add</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18060</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When lnd module starts, some parameters are set to some values.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For instance, in o2iblnd, lnd_peercredits_hiw is changed to be between lct_peer_tx_credits/2 and lct_peer_tx_credits-1.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When a NI is added using lnetctl, these modifications are not done.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Depending on the parameter, either an automatic set, or a warning could be triggered.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
